<view class="page-shell sub-page" style="{{statusBarStyle}}">
  <view class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack" aria-label="返回"><image class="nav-back-icon" src="/assets/ui/v4/back-strong.svg" /></view>
  <text class="eyebrow">授权与隐私</text>
  <text class="page-title">隐私授权</text>
  <text class="page-lede">每一项都单独授权，也都可以随时收回。</text>
  <text wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading-text">正在读取授权状态…</text>
  <text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-text">{{error}}</text>

  <text class="group-label">长期记忆</text>
  <view class="list">
    <view class="list-row" bindtap="openChildMemory">
      <mp-icon name="note" tone="ink"></mp-icon>
      <view class="row-copy">
        <text class="row-title">孩子的长期记忆</text>
        <text class="row-meta">只记称呼、喜好和宠物名，在「孩子的记忆」里开关</text>
      </view>
      <image class="row-chev" src="/assets/ui/v4/chev-faint.svg" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <text class="privacy-note">小程序只管理授权，不采集或中转实时音频。</text>
</view>
